OREGON STATE POLICE
Freedom of Information Act Request
Pursuant to 5 U.S.C. =A7 552 and ORS 192.311 et seq.

To Whom It May Concern,

I am submitting this public records request for all records related to a la=
w enforcement visit that occurred on March 24, 2026 at the Siltcoos Work Ce=
nter, U.S. Forest Service, Siuslaw National Forest, located at 82900 Highwa=
y 101, Florence, Oregon 97439 =97 a locked federal facility on restricted f=
ederal land.

On that date, two Oregon State Police officers accompanied U.S. Forest Serv=
ice Special Agent Matthew Oliver to my residence at that location. Their st=
ated purpose was concern about content I had posted online. I declined to s=
peak without an attorney. I recorded their departure. Oregon plate 731 QRV =
is visible on camera.

I am requesting the following records:

The full names, badge numbers, and unit assignments of the two Oregon State=
 Police officers present at 82900 Highway 101, Florence, Oregon 97439 on Ma=
rch 24, 2026.

All communications =97 internal or external =97 related to the planning, au=
thorization, or coordination of this visit, including communications with t=
he U.S. Forest Service, Oregon Parks and Recreation Department, or any othe=
r agency.

All records identifying who initiated contact between Oregon State Police a=
nd any other agency in connection with this visit.

Any records referencing my name (Robert Samuel White), my online archive, o=
r the domain oprdvolunteerabuse.org in connection with this visit or any re=
lated matter.

Any incident reports, after-action documentation, or case files generated i=
n connection with this visit.

This visit occurred on the one-year anniversary of my dismissal from Oregon=
 State Parks volunteer service. The stated reason for the visit was content=
 I had posted online about that dismissal. That is a First Amendment matter=
. I have a right to know who was at my door and why.

I request a fee waiver on the grounds that disclosure of this information i=
s in the public interest and will contribute significantly to public unders=
tanding of law enforcement conduct and interagency coordination. I am not s=
eeking this information for commercial purposes.

Please respond within the timeframe required by Oregon public records law. =
If any portion of this request is denied, please provide a written explanat=
ion citing the specific statutory exemption claimed.

Please be advised that I am preserving all rights and remedies available to=
 me under state and federal law in connection with this matter, including l=
itigation. You are hereby on notice to preserve all records, communications=
, and documentation related to the March 24, 2026 visit to 82900 Highway 10=
1, Florence, Oregon 97439, including but not limited to all records respons=
ive to this request. Destruction or alteration of any such records may cons=
titute spoliation and will be treated accordingly.

Robert Samuel White
P.O. Box 334
Reedsport, Oregon 97467
Phone: 458-230-1869
rsw@rswfire.com


